{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>買一束向日葵、一個寫住名字的生日蛋糕，帶埋佢最鍾意嘅小皮鞋同零食上山。<br/><br/>宏福苑火災一周年。一年前，一場大火奪去五歲女兒的生命；一年後，鄭先生在女兒生忌帶着蛋糕與向日葵上山，在墓前與日常之間，回望這段失去後的日子。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>相關文字報道：<br/><br/><a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%ab%e4%b8%80%e5%b9%b4-%e6%84%9b%e5%a5%b3%e7%94%9f%e5%bf%8c-%e7%88%b6%e5%a2%b3%e5%89%8d%e5%94%b1%e7%94%9f%e6%97%a5%e6%ad%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑大火一年｜愛女六歲生忌　父墳前唱生日歌　最想說「對唔住，爸爸救你唔到」　</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.590041+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:45:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:37:11.944042+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.072212+00:00","content_hash":"1115a9223facdfb9de4ee6d1ff119f0208e5365fa312d52cdd344bf38b0c3e22","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}